	The auto-wah, is basically a combination of an envelope follower and a resonant lowpass filter. For increasing level both the frequency and the bandwidth of the filter will increase. How much is controlled by ''Drive''. For a normal wah, use a pedal to control ''Frequency'' and set ''Drive'' to zero.', 'http://drobilla.net/plugins/fomp/autowah', '1:0.0-7', 1, 0, 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/56c4bc95770cb318f9cd416a/screenshot/', 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/56c4bc95770cb318f9cd416a/thumbnail/', 261, 430, '{"avatarUrl":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/4410000c45e9a79083309150d4f78d87","name":"David Robillard"}', '["Filter"]', '[{"default":0,"max":20,"min":-20,"name":"Drive"},{"default":0,"max":1,"min":0,"name":"Decay"},{"default":0.5,"max":1,"min":0,"name":"Range"},{"default":0.25,"max":1,"min":0,"name":"Freq"},{"default":0.75,"max":1,"min":0,"name":"Mix"}]');

