Chops audio into individual beats and shifts each beat downwards in pitch. Only allowing downwards shifts helps keep timing very tight - depending on complexity, whole rhythm sections can be shifted!

Alternative uses include a triggered flanger or sub-octave doubler (both with mix set to 50% or less) and a swing quantizer (with a high threshold so not all beats trigger).', 'http://moddevices.com/plugins/mda/RePsycho', '1:0.1-6', 1, 0, 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/56c4bd42770cb318f9cd4d80/screenshot/', 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/56c4bd42770cb318f9cd4d80/thumbnail/', 261, 430, '{"avatarUrl":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/ad35377ca6426dd6fbb85267619e7150","name":"MOD Team"}', '["Spectral","Pitch Shifter"]', '[{"default":-12,"max":0,"min":-24,"name":"Tune"},{"default":0,"max":0,"min":-99,"name":"Fine"},{"default":-37,"max":50,"min":-50,"name":"Decay"},{"default":-25,"max":0,"min":-30,"name":"Thresh"},{"default":162.33999633789062,"max":260,"min":10,"name":"Hold"},{"default":90,"max":100,"min":0,"name":"Mix"},{"default":1,"max":1,"min":0,"name":"Quality"}]');

