These kits are intended to bring an authentic acoustic, organic drum sound to your arrangements and preserve real-world characteristics such as tom ringing and overtones,
unlike many General MIDI kits that sound sterile.
AVL Drumkits feature 5 sample layers per kit piece. The shell samples provide both center and edge hits to emulate right and left hands and the cymbals are quite realistic without truncated samples.', 'http://kxstudio.linuxaudio.org/plugins/FluidPlug_Red_Zeppelin_5', '1:2.0-6', 1, 0, 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/580897e5fca7d905d9f1e1fd/screenshot/', 'https://api.moddevices.com/v2/lv2/plugins/580897e5fca7d905d9f1e1fd/thumbnail/', 221, 307, '{"avatarUrl":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/none","name":"falkTX"}', '["Generator","Instrument"]', '[{"default":1,"max":2,"min":0,"name":"Level"}]');

